# Metamorph Ability Descriptions
morphext.metamorph.desc.amphibian=Amphibian: You do not run out of oxygen underwater; the breath bar is hidden, allowing you to stay submerged indefinitely.
morphext.metamorph.desc.armorless=Armorless: Any worn armor is stripped and dropped, leaving only items held in your main hand and offhand.
morphext.metamorph.desc.arrow_loose_packet=Arrow Loose Sync: Synchronizes mob bow release aiming animations. Visual effect only, does not alter projectile damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.arrow_nock_packet=Arrow Nock Sync: Synchronizes mob bow draw aiming animations. Visual effect only, does not alter projectile damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.arrowless=Arrowless: Bows can be drawn and fired without consuming or requiring arrows in your inventory.
morphext.metamorph.desc.baby_zombie_stats=Baby Zombie Stats: Gain the rapid movement speed and small hitbox of a baby zombie.
morphext.metamorph.desc.backup=Call Reinforcements: When injured, nearby mobs will turn to attack your aggressor; zombie pigmen are also provoked.
morphext.metamorph.desc.bat_flight=Bat Flight: Fly like a bat, allowing free omnidirectional aerial movement.
morphext.metamorph.desc.bear_tactics=Polar Bear Tactics: Briefly increases strength and resistance at the expense of movement speed when rearing up on hind legs.
morphext.metamorph.desc.become_morph_dragon=Become MorphDragon: Automatically transforms into MorphDragon upon morphing into an Ender Dragon, granting dragon flight and abilities.
morphext.metamorph.desc.blaze_flight=Blaze Flight: Ascend continuously by holding jump while airborne and not sneaking.
morphext.metamorph.desc.blaze_update=Blaze Behavior: Charge up and fire bursts of small fireballs like a Blaze, synchronizing animations to others.
morphext.metamorph.desc.bow_movement_up=Agile Archer: Move at full speed while drawing and firing bows, strafing like a skeleton.
morphext.metamorph.desc.chicken_egg_lay=Egg Laying: Periodically lay an egg at your feet like a chicken.
morphext.metamorph.desc.chicken_riding=Chicken Jockey: Right-click a chicken to mount it; the chicken gains speed and follows your look direction.
morphext.metamorph.desc.climb=Climb: Walk into vertical walls to scale them upward without ladders.
morphext.metamorph.desc.cpae=Creeper Fuse Overhaul: Detonates at your current position when fuse burns out; blast radius doubled if charged. In survival mode, deals lethal damage, grants brief invisibility, then resets fuse.
morphext.metamorph.desc.creeper_charge=Charged Creeper: Automatically become charged when struck by lightning, doubling explosion radius.
morphext.metamorph.desc.demorph=Demorph: Automatically reverts to normal player form upon transforming into this morph.
morphext.metamorph.desc.dragon_flight=Dragon Flight: Fly at high speed like an Ender Dragon, dealing collision damage to entities in your flight path.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ender_affinity=Ender Affinity: Chance to instantly teleport away to evade incoming projectiles such as arrows, cancelling damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.enderman_enemy=Enderman Foe: Nearby Endermen will actively aggro onto you even without direct eye contact.
morphext.metamorph.desc.fire_proof=Fire Immunity: Immune to fire, lava, and burning damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.flight=Free Flight: Hover and fly through the air like a Ghast, using jump to ascend and sneak to descend.
morphext.metamorph.desc.generic_blank_arrow=Arrow Conjuration: Shoot plain arrows without requiring arrow items in your inventory.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ghast_update=Ghast Behavior: Charge up and fire large explosive fireballs like a Ghast, synchronizing animations.
morphext.metamorph.desc.glide=Gliding: Drift downwards slowly like a chicken, eliminating fall damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.golem_enemy=Village Foe: Nearby Iron Golems and Snow Golems will actively attack you on sight.
morphext.metamorph.desc.guardian_general=Guardian Spikes: Emit thorns damage to nearby attackers when hit in melee underwater, and synchronizes laser targeting.
morphext.metamorph.desc.guardian_swim=Guardian Swimming: Swim quickly and turn with high maneuverability underwater like a Guardian.
morphext.metamorph.desc.hands_off=Clumsy Hands: Cannot open inventory, chests, or container interfaces; any opened UI will be forcefully closed.
morphext.metamorph.desc.harming_to_healing=Inverted Harming: Splashing or taking instant damage potions heals you instead of dealing damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.hide_hotbar=Hide Hotbar: Hides the hotbar HUD from the screen.
morphext.metamorph.desc.hide_hungerbar=Hide Hunger: Hunger bar is hidden and food level remains permanently full.
morphext.metamorph.desc.hostile=Hostile Demeanor: Regular hostile monsters will not actively target you, but village defenders remain hostile.
morphext.metamorph.desc.illager_updater=Illager Spellcraft: Automatically cast Evoker fangs, conjure Vexes, inflict blindness, or cast disappear spells.
morphext.metamorph.desc.itemless=Itemless: Inventory is cleared, armor unequipped, and both hotbar and hunger bar are hidden.
morphext.metamorph.desc.jumping=Leaping: Vastly increased jump height and leap distance.
morphext.metamorph.desc.knockback_immune=Knockback Immunity: Completely immune to knockback when attacked.
morphext.metamorph.desc.knockback_resistant=Knockback Resistance: Significantly reduces knockback distance taken from attacks.
morphext.metamorph.desc.magic_resistance=Magic Resistance: Substantially reduces damage taken from magic and instant damage effects.
morphext.metamorph.desc.melter=Melter: Takes continuous fire damage when located in hot or arid biomes like a Snow Golem.
morphext.metamorph.desc.mooshroom_interaction=Mooshroom Interaction: Others can right-click you with a bowl for mushroom stew, or with shears to drop mushrooms and revert to a cow.
morphext.metamorph.desc.natural_armor=Natural Armor: Directly inherits the native armor attribute of the mob form, mitigating incoming damage.
morphext.metamorph.desc.new_sun_allergy=Severe Sun Allergy: Burns in direct sunlight during the day; equipped helmets degrade rapidly.
morphext.metamorph.desc.night_vision=Night Vision: Grants continuous night vision, revealing everything clearly in the dark.
morphext.metamorph.desc.no_clip=No Clip: Disables solid collision, allowing you to move through blocks and terrain.
morphext.metamorph.desc.pig_lightning_struck=Pigman Zombification: Automatically transforms into a Zombie Pigman and gains fire immunity when struck by lightning.
morphext.metamorph.desc.pig_saddle=Saddleable: Other players can right-click you with a saddle to ride you; demorphing automatically dismounts them.
morphext.metamorph.desc.prevent_fall=Fall Immunity: Completely immune to fall damage; drop safely from any height.
morphext.metamorph.desc.rabbit_hop=Rabbit Hop: Hop forward like a rabbit with cushioned landings.
morphext.metamorph.desc.regenerative=Regeneration: Passively regenerates health over time.
morphext.metamorph.desc.rideable=Rideable: Other players can right-click to mount you; demorphing dismounts them.
morphext.metamorph.desc.rotten=Undead Biology: Immune to poison status effects like an undead creature.
morphext.metamorph.desc.sheep_interactions=Sheep Interaction: Others can right-click you with dye to color your fleece, or with shears to harvest wool.
morphext.metamorph.desc.silverfish_summon=Silverfish Call: When attacked, infested blocks nearby shatter to summon silverfish allies to retaliate.
morphext.metamorph.desc.sinker=Sinker: Sinks directly to the bottom of liquids without natural buoyancy.
morphext.metamorph.desc.skeleton_arrow=Infused Arrows: Fired arrows inherit mob traits (Wither skeleton arrows inflict Wither, Stray arrows inflict Slowness).
morphext.metamorph.desc.slime_contact=Slime Collision: Deals contact damage to entities upon physical collision like a Slime.
morphext.metamorph.desc.slime_jumping=Slime Bouncing: Bounces repeatedly in place with squishy sound effects.
morphext.metamorph.desc.snow_golem_pumpkin=Shear Pumpkin: Others can use shears to remove your pumpkin head, turning you into a bare Snow Golem.
morphext.metamorph.desc.snow_walk=Snow Trail: Leaves a layer of snow behind as you walk like a Snow Golem.
morphext.metamorph.desc.spider_riding=Spider Jockey: Right-click a spider or cave spider to mount and steer it.
morphext.metamorph.desc.squid=Squid Behavior: Swim freely in water and squirt blinding ink clouds backward.
morphext.metamorph.desc.squid_swim=Squid Swimming: Swim swiftly and maneuver agilely in water like a squid.
morphext.metamorph.desc.step_up=Step Assist: Walk up full 1-block steps automatically without jumping.
morphext.metamorph.desc.sun_allergy=Sun Allergy: Burns when exposed to direct sunlight during daytime like zombies and skeletons.
morphext.metamorph.desc.vex_flight=Vex Flight: Fly freely through blocks and terrain like a Vex.
morphext.metamorph.desc.villager_lightning_struck=Witch Transformation: Automatically transforms into a Witch with magic resistance when struck by lightning.
morphext.metamorph.desc.vindicator_update=Vindicator Frenzy: Attacks aggressively with axes and can toggle aggression towards all living creatures.
morphext.metamorph.desc.water_allergy=Hydrophobia: Takes continuous damage when in contact with water or rain like an Enderman.
morphext.metamorph.desc.water_breath=Water Breathing: Breathe underwater indefinitely without drowning.
morphext.metamorph.desc.web_walker=Web Walker: Walk through cobwebs at full speed without being slowed down.
morphext.metamorph.desc.wither_armor=Wither Armor: Deflects all incoming projectile attacks while health is above 50%.
morphext.metamorph.desc.wither_block_break=Wither Rampage: Obliterates surrounding blocks when damaged, except bedrock and indestructible materials.
morphext.metamorph.desc.wither_flight=Wither Flight: Hover and fly freely in the air while health is above 50%.
morphext.metamorph.desc.witherless=Wither Immunity: Completely immune to the Wither effect; cleanses any existing Wither upon morphing.
morphext.metamorph.desc.wolf_enemy=Wolf Rival: Untamed wolves in the vicinity will actively attack you.
morphext.metamorph.desc.wolf_sit=Wolf Sit: Sneak to toggle sitting posture, preventing all movement while seated.
morphext.metamorph.desc.zombie_reinforcements=Zombie Reinforcements: Taking damage on Hard difficulty has a chance to summon zombie reinforcements.
morphext.metamorph.desc.mob=Mob Attack: Left-click attack inherits the damage and combat style of the mob form.
morphext.metamorph.desc.synced_mob=Synced Mob Attack: Left-click attack inherits mob attack style and synchronizes animations to other players.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ai_target=Command Aggro: Command the morphed mob to attack the entity in your crosshairs; sneak-cast to clear target.
morphext.metamorph.desc.mob_act=Universal Aggro Command: Command any morphed mob form to attack your crosshair target; sneak-cast to clear target.
morphext.metamorph.desc.bear_standing=Bear Stand: Toggle standing posture as a polar bear to synergize with combat tactics.
morphext.metamorph.desc.blaze_fireball=Blaze Fireball: Launch rapid small fireballs forward with a brief cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.desc.block_goblin_throw=Block Goblin Throw: Toggle block-throwing mode to hurl blocks at enemies (Requires Twilight Forest).
morphext.metamorph.desc.carrot_eat=Carrot Feast: Consume carrot crops underfoot to harvest carrots and replant the crop.
morphext.metamorph.desc.creeper_explode=Creeper Fuse: Ignite fuse to swell and detonate; cast again to defuse.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ender_dragon_fireball=Dragon Fireball: Launch an explosive Ender Dragon fireball that leaves lingering dragon breath clouds.
morphext.metamorph.desc.enderman_teleport=Enderman Teleport: Teleport a short distance towards your crosshairs, carrying held blocks.
morphext.metamorph.desc.endermite=Endermite Scuttle: Randomly teleport short distances to dodge enemy attacks.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ghast_fireball=Ghast Fireball: Spit a giant explosive fireball forward with a cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.desc.horse_jump=Horse Leap: Charge up a powerful leap; sneak-cast to release instantly with minimum charge.
morphext.metamorph.desc.illager_spellcast=Illager Spellcast: Randomly cast one of four Evoker spells: fangs, vexes, blindness, or invisibility.
morphext.metamorph.desc.invisibility=Invisibility: Grants temporary invisibility, making you much harder to detect.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ocelot_forms=Cycle Cat Breeds: Cycle through different cat breeds and textures.
morphext.metamorph.desc.sheep_grass_eating=Graze: Eat grass underfoot to regrow sheared wool and restore fleece color.
morphext.metamorph.desc.slime_size=Slime Scaling: Increase slime size; sneak-cast to shrink. Size affects health and jumping power.
morphext.metamorph.desc.sliverfish=Infest Stone: Look at stone to burrow inside as an infested block; sneak-cast to convert target stone to infested stone.
morphext.metamorph.desc.sliverfish_reveal=Emerge: Burst out of an infested stone block and revert back to silverfish form.
morphext.metamorph.desc.snowball=Throw Snowball: Throw a snowball forward to knock enemies back.
morphext.metamorph.desc.spider_web=Spin Web: Spin a cobweb at your feet or target location to trap foes.
morphext.metamorph.desc.spit=Llama Spit: Spit a damaging projectile forward.
morphext.metamorph.desc.villager_profession=Cycle Profession: Cycle between different villager professions and outfits.
morphext.metamorph.desc.witch_potion=Potion Toss: Hurl a splash potion forward with various status effects.
morphext.metamorph.desc.wither_skull=Wither Skull: Launch a wither skull projectile that explodes and applies the Wither effect.
morphext.metamorph.desc.wolf_forms=Toggle Wolf Rage: Toggle between tame wolf and enraged wolf states with heightened aggression.
morphext.metamorph.desc.echolocation=Echolocation: Emit a high-frequency ultrasonic wave that grants night vision and illuminates all entities within 24 blocks with glowing aura, disorienting close foes.
morphext.metamorph.desc.shulker_bullet=Shulker Bullet: Launch a homing missile toward the locked target, dealing damage and inflicting levitation.
morphext.metamorph.desc.shulker_shell=Shell Armor: Hunker down inside the indestructible purpur shell, gaining Resistance IV (80% damage reduction) and Slowness IV for 5 seconds.
morphext.metamorph.desc.prismarine_laser=Prismarine Laser: Fire a concentrated sea-energy beam along your crosshairs that deals direct magic damage, dealing increased damage to wet or submerged targets.
morphext.metamorph.desc.elder_curse=Elder Curse: Unleash an ancient temple curse in a 16-block radius, inflicting Mining Fatigue III, Slowness II, and Weakness I, accompanied by ghostly apparitions.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ground_slam=Ground Slam: Slam the earth with titanic iron strength, dealing heavy physical damage and hurling all surrounding enemies high into the air.
morphext.metamorph.desc.rapid_shot=Rapid Shot: Fire a quick fan-burst of 3 precision arrows in a conical spread.
morphext.metamorph.desc.frost_shot=Frost Shot: Fire a fan-burst of 3 glacial arrows infused with Slowness II for 7 seconds.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ink_jet=Ink Jet: Squirt a dense cloud of blinding black ink that blinds and slows surrounding enemies while jet-propelling you forward.
morphext.metamorph.desc.wolf_howl=Alpha Howl: Let out a resonant battle howl to inspire yourself and nearby allies with Strength, Speed, and Resistance for 10 seconds, while frightening and weakening nearby skeletons.
morphext.metamorph.desc.feline_pounce=Feline Pounce: Leap forward with agile feline grace, gaining Speed II and Jump Boost II, while hissing to defuse and repel nearby Creepers.
morphext.metamorph.desc.snowstorm_volley=Snowstorm Volley: Unleash a rapid-fire barrage of 5 packed snowballs in a flurry cone to suppress and knock back foes.
morphext.metamorph.desc.blaze_fire_ring=Inferno Ring: Erupt in an 8-way radial burst of blazing fireballs, igniting and repelling all approaching threats.
morphext.metamorph.desc.web_trap=Web Trap: Spit a sticky cobweb strand that entangles enemies with heavy Slowness IV and Weakness, or spins a cobweb block at target location.
morphext.metamorph.desc.pigman_rage=Nether Fury: Let out an enraged pigman roar, unleashing berserk combat instincts that grant Strength II, Speed I, and Resistance I for 7 seconds.
morphext.metamorph.desc.iron_fortitude=Iron Fortitude: Tighten your armored chassis into a defensive stance, gaining Resistance II and Knockback Resistance at the cost of slight Slowness I.
morphext.metamorph.desc.heavy_toss=Heavy Toss: Deliver a devastating upward swing with your iron arms, dealing heavy damage and launching the enemy into the air.
morphext.metamorph.desc.ultrasonic_shriek=Ultrasonic Shriek: Release a high-pitch disorienting screech that inflicts Nausea, Weakness, and sonic disruption to nearby enemies.
morphext.metamorph.desc.spike_burst=Spike Burst: Rapidly deploy prismarine spikes across your body, puncturing adjacent foes and knocking them away.
morphext.metamorph.desc.spectral_daze=Spectral Daze: Unleash an elder temple manifestation that blinds nearby enemies and inflicts severe Slowness and Weakness.
morphext.metamorph.desc.furious_bite=Furious Bite: Lunge forward and sink razor fangs into the enemy, dealing rending damage, Slowness, and Hunger.
morphext.metamorph.desc.blaze_fireball=Blaze Fireball: Launch a small flaming projectile forward, igniting the target on contact.
morphext.metamorph.desc.venom_strike=Venom Strike: Spring forward and deliver a venomous fang strike, poisoning and slowing the victim.
morphext.metamorph.desc.strafe_dodge=Strafe Dodge: Perform a nimble tactical roll backward to escape danger and gain a brief speed surge.
morphext.metamorph.desc.frost_aura=Frost Aura: Release a chilling burst of glacial wind, heavily damaging and freezing surrounding hostile entities.

# Vanilla Livestock & Passive Mob Actions
morphext.metamorph.action.cow_milk=Milk & Ruminate
morphext.metamorph.desc.cow_milk=Milk & Ruminate: Hold an empty bucket to milk fresh milk (5s cooldown); if not holding an empty bucket, ruminate to restore 1 hunger and saturation and cure 1 negative potion effect (15s cooldown).
morphext.metamorph.action.mooshroom_harvest=Mooshroom Harvest
morphext.metamorph.desc.mooshroom_harvest=Mooshroom Harvest: Hold a bowl to get mushroom stew (3s cooldown), an empty bucket for milk (5s cooldown), or shears to harvest 5 red mushrooms (60s cooldown).
morphext.metamorph.action.sheep_graze=Graze & Shear
morphext.metamorph.desc.sheep_graze=Graze & Shear: Graze on grass beneath or in front of you to turn it into dirt and restore 2 hunger and saturation (20s cooldown); hold shears to harvest 1-3 wool (45s cooldown).
morphext.metamorph.action.chicken_lay_egg=Lay Egg
morphext.metamorph.desc.chicken_lay_egg=Lay Egg: Lay a fresh egg beneath you, 45s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.pig_rooting=Rooting Forage
morphext.metamorph.desc.pig_rooting=Rooting Forage: Snout-root through grass or dirt to uncover hidden treasures (carrots, potatoes, beetroots, or beetroot seeds), 30s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.iron_repair=Iron Repair
morphext.metamorph.desc.iron_repair=Iron Repair: Hold an iron ingot to hammer-repair your iron chassis, consuming 1 iron ingot to restore 25 health, 5s cooldown.

# Livestock Action Prompts
morphext.action.cow_milk.prompt=Hold empty bucket to milk
morphext.action.mooshroom_harvest.prompt=Hold bowl for stew, bucket for milk, or shears for mushrooms
morphext.action.sheep_graze.prompt=Stand on grass to graze, or hold shears to harvest wool
morphext.action.pig_rooting.prompt=Must root on grass or dirt
morphext.action.iron_repair.prompt=Hold iron ingot to repair

# Human Stature
ability.morphext.human_stature=Human Stature
ability.morphext.human_stature.desc=Morph model & size adapter: Cycle through 3 modes:\n1. [Human Model]: Keep all skills but force standard player model & hitbox;\n2. [Smart Scale]: Keep monster appearance but smartly scale height to 1.8 blocks;\n3. [Off]: Natural morph size (default).
morphext.stature.mode.0=Off
morphext.stature.mode.1=Human Model
morphext.stature.mode.2=Smart Scale
morphext.stature.switched=Human Stature set to: %s

# Variants
morphext.variant.baby=(Baby)

# Standard Passives
morphext.passive.morphext.fly.name=Flight
morphext.passive.morphext.fly.desc=Grants the ability to freely fly through the skies.
morphext.passive.morphext.water_breath.name=Water Breathing
morphext.passive.morphext.water_breath.desc=Breathe freely underwater without drowning.
morphext.passive.morphext.prevent_fall.name=Feather Fall
morphext.passive.morphext.prevent_fall.desc=Complete immunity to fall damage and slow gliding in air.
morphext.passive.morphext.creeper_repel.name=Creeper Deterrence
morphext.passive.morphext.creeper_repel.desc=Emits an aura that scares creepers away within 16 blocks.
morphext.passive.morphext.thorns.name=Prismarine Thorns
morphext.passive.morphext.thorns.desc=Reflects damage back to melee attackers.
morphext.passive.morphext.iron_knockback_res.name=Steadfast Iron
morphext.passive.morphext.iron_knockback_res.desc=Grants full knockback resistance.
morphext.passive.morphext.feline_speed.name=Feline Agility
morphext.passive.morphext.feline_speed.desc=Grants bonus movement speed.
morphext.passive.immunity_damage.name=Damage Immunity
morphext.passive.immunity_damage.desc=Complete immunity to specific damage types.
morphext.passive.immunity_potion.name=Potion Immunity
morphext.passive.immunity_potion.desc=Complete immunity to specific harmful potions and plagues.

# Unified Vanilla Mob Actions (UAPA)
morphext.metamorph.action.creeper_fuse=Creeper Fuse
morphext.metamorph.desc.creeper_fuse=Creeper Fuse: Prime fuse for 1.5s with hissing sounds and swelling smoke, then detonate a safe 3.0-power shockwave dealing heavy damage and knockback to surrounding foes without damaging the host, 20s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.creeper_hiss=Creeper Hiss
morphext.metamorph.desc.creeper_hiss=Creeper Hiss: Emit an alarming creeper hiss, panicking surrounding non-friendly entities within 10 blocks and inflicting Slowness for 3s, 10s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.wither_strike=Wither Strike
morphext.metamorph.desc.wither_strike=Wither Strike: Cleave a 3.5-block arc in front of you with a withered blade, dealing 9 dark damage and inflicting Wither II for 10s, accompanied by dark particles, 6s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.wither_skull_throw=Wither Skull Throw
morphext.metamorph.desc.wither_skull_throw=Wither Skull Throw: Launch a deadly wither skull projectile along your crosshair with a safe forward offset of 1.5 blocks to prevent self-collision, 12s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.witch_throw_potion=Witch Potion Toss
morphext.metamorph.desc.witch_throw_potion=Witch Potion Toss: Hurl a random splash potion of harm (Slowness, Poison, Weakness, or Harming) forward with safe trajectory offset, 8s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.witch_drink_potion=Drink Elixir
morphext.metamorph.desc.witch_drink_potion=Drink Elixir: Chug a restorative brew to heal 6 health points and gain Fire Resistance for 15s, 25s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.evoker_fangs=Evoker Fangs
morphext.metamorph.desc.evoker_fangs=Evoker Fangs: Summon a straight line of 12 snapping evoker fangs along your crosshairs; sneak-cast to summon a double protective ring of fangs around yourself, immune to host, 15s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.evoker_vex_summon=Summon Vexes
morphext.metamorph.desc.evoker_vex_summon=Summon Vexes: Chant dark illager incantations to summon 2 loyal sword-wielding vexes for 30s, 45s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.vex_phase=Vex Phase
morphext.metamorph.desc.vex_phase=Vex Phase: Glow crimson and perform a high-speed 12-block dash through blocks and entities, piercing enemies in your trajectory, 8s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.vindicator_axe_charge=Axe Charge
morphext.metamorph.desc.vindicator_axe_charge=Axe Charge: Raise your iron axe in a berserk rush (Speed II for 3s), delivering a lethal 12-damage cleave that disables blocking shields on hit, 12s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.illusion_blindness=Illusion Blindness
morphext.metamorph.desc.illusion_blindness=Illusion Blindness: Fire a blinding spell ray along crosshairs that blinds target for 8s while granting you Invisibility and Speed II for 6s with decoy illusion particles, 20s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.enderman_teleport=Sight Teleport
morphext.metamorph.desc.enderman_teleport=Sight Teleport: Teleport instantly to target surface along crosshairs up to 32 blocks away with anti-suffocation spatial validation and portal fx, 8s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.enderman_screech=Enderman Screech
morphext.metamorph.desc.enderman_screech=Enderman Screech: Open jaws wide and emit an ear-splitting roar, terrifying enemies within 12 blocks with Weakness and Blindness for 3s, 18s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.slime_bounce_slam=Slime Bounce Slam
morphext.metamorph.desc.slime_bounce_slam=Slime Bounce Slam: Launch high into the air with a sticky spring leap, triggering a viscous ground shockwave on landing that damages and slows foes, 10s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.magma_slam=Magma Slam
morphext.metamorph.desc.magma_slam=Magma Slam: Spring high into the air with volcanic force, erupting in an infernal lava ring upon landing that ignites surrounding enemies, 12s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.llama_spit=Llama Spit
morphext.metamorph.desc.llama_spit=Llama Spit: Spit 2 damaging spitballs in rapid succession along crosshairs, dealing damage and knockback with safe offset, 4s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.rabbit_hop=Rabbit Hop
morphext.metamorph.desc.rabbit_hop=Rabbit Hop: Leap swiftly forward and upward to vault over 2-block barriers with nimble grace, 5s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.polar_maul=Polar Maul
morphext.metamorph.desc.polar_maul=Polar Maul: Rise on hind legs and maul enemies within 3.5 blocks, dealing 12 heavy physical damage and inflicting Slowness II for 5s, 8s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.ghast_fireball=Ghast Fireball
morphext.metamorph.desc.ghast_fireball=Ghast Fireball: Shriek and launch a massive explosive fireball along crosshairs with 1.8-block safe spawn offset, 15s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.zombie_infectious_strike=Infectious Strike
morphext.metamorph.desc.zombie_infectious_strike=Infectious Strike: Slash with decayed claws in a 3.5-block arc, dealing damage and inflicting Hunger for 8s and Slowness for 3s, 6s cooldown.
morphext.metamorph.action.husk_sand_strike=Sand Strike
morphext.metamorph.desc.husk_sand_strike=Sand Strike: Bite with desert ferocity kicking up a cloud of blinding sand, inflicting severe Hunger II for 12s and Slowness for 4s, 6s cooldown.
